                "text": "I had a great conversation last week with\u00a0@USDOL\u00a0Assistant Secretary Lisa M. Gomez and advocates about strengthening mental health coverage\u2014including two of my bills that were signed into law! We've got more work to do for every American to get the care they need. https://t.co/4XQo7tGTTG",
