                "source": "Twitter Media Studio",
                "text": "Consumers sued J&J alleging that its baby powder caused cancer. J&J then split its company into two halves to skirt accountability. And, it argued that this finance scheme should be secret\u2014but patients should have to make disclosures to get justice.\n\nI called out this hypocrisy. https://t.co/0vePXhkJeZ",
