                "retweet_count": 121,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Too many Americans can't get mental health care. Four of my proposals to address this crisis are now law:\n\u2611\ufe0fEnforcing mental health parity\n\u2611\ufe0fDelivering coverage to public servants\n\u2611\ufe0fCreating a maternal mental health hotline\n\u2611\ufe0fFunding the Veterans Crisis Line\n#WorldMentalHealthDay",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
