                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Kudos to @CMSgov for hosting patient listening sessions on each drug up for Medicare negotiation. Cracking down on Big Pharma\u2019s greed only happens when policymakers lift up the voices of patients\u2014instead of doing the bidding of special interests.",
