                "text": "Many Americans aren\u2019t aware that deferring Medicare coverage can result in higher health care costs for their rest of their lives. I just reintroduced my common-sense Medicare Economic Security Solutions Act with @RepYoungKim to cap late enrollment fees for seniors.",
