                "retweet_count": 669,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Greedy private health insurers that offer Medicare Advantage plans prey on taxpayers and deny care to seniors to maximize profits. Last year, I urged @CMSgov to boost oversight and penalties for insurers that improperly deny coverage. Now, new rules will protect patients.",
