                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare Advantage doesn\u2019t make health care cheaper for taxpayers or better for patients\u2014so why doesn\u2019t Congress change how it works?\n\n@WendellPotter is right. It's because private health insurers spend millions lobbying elected officials to protect their profits. https://t.co/zTRH7lyGcU",
