                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "America\u2019s two biggest dialysis providers\u2014representing 80% of the market\u2014are screwing workers with low wages and long hours.\n\nSince my first term, I've led oversight of how these companies put profits before patients. Proud to stand with @seiu_uhw and glad our movement is growing. https://t.co/f4dlD2nuLg",
